  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "In order to rank-up, you need to bring the ",
      "wolverine items. Wolverines are known as wild ",
      "animals with special abilities.",
      "Hunters have thrown wolverines to prison in the ",
      "past but somehow they manage to escape every ",
      "time. They live in the forests and seem to appear",
      "at night only, so you will have to wander around ",
      "the forests at night to find one.",
      "You must bring 3 items that wolverines drop.",
      "They are horn, claw, and tale.",
      "Remember, you must kill 3 different types of ",
      "wolverines to acquire all 3 items.",
      "Good luck!!",
      "",
      "[Quest Mission]",
      " ",
      "Acquire horn, claw, and tale from each wolverine."
    ]
  },
